      <article class="relationship-card relationship-production-card"><header><div><h3>射孔与生产动态</h3><p>按统一井键直接汇总已挂载 OFM MDB 映射出的射孔、月产量和开关井事件；其他生产导入文件也会一并列明。</p></div><span class="${productionSummary||perforations.count||productionFormation?'':'warn'}">${production.from_ofm_mdb?'OFM 已关联':productionSources.length?'已关联':'待导入'}</span></header><div class="relationship-production-sources"><h4>关联来源</h4>${productionSourceRows||'<p>当前没有与该井匹配的 OFM / 生产动态来源。</p>'}</div><div class="relationship-evidence"><section><h4>射孔 / 生产层段</h4><div class="relationship-list">${perforationRows||'<p>当前未传入该井明确射孔段。OFM 的“层系 / YACIMIENTO”属于生产层系证据，不等价于射孔顶底深。</p>'}</div><small>已匹配 ${fmt(production.record_counts?.perforations||perforations.count||0)} 个射孔记录${productionFormation?` · OFM 层系：${esc(productionFormation)}`:''}${ofmDeviation.count?` · OFM 轨迹 ${fmt(ofmDeviation.count)} 点（MD ${relNumber(ofmDeviation.min_md)}–${relNumber(ofmDeviation.max_md)}）`:''}。</small><div class="relationship-production-events">${productionMarkerRows||'<span>OFM 未映射到井上标志 / 产层标志</span>'}</div></section><section><h4>动态汇总</h4>${productionSummary?`<p><strong>投产：</strong>${esc(productionSummary.onstream_date||'待补')} · ${fmt(productionSummary.production_months||0)} 个生产月</p><p><strong>初期：</strong>日产液 ${relNumber(productionSummary.initial_liquid_rate)} · 日产油 ${relNumber(productionSummary.initial_oil_rate)} · 含水 ${relNumber(productionSummary.initial_water_cut)}%</p><p><strong>累产：</strong>油 ${relNumber(productionSummary.cumulative_oil)} · 水 ${relNumber(productionSummary.cumulative_water)} · 压力变化 ${relNumber(productionSummary.pressure_change)}</p><button class="link-button" type="button" data-open-production-series="${esc(selected?.project_key||'')}">打开可调生产曲线 →</button>`:'<p>尚无可汇总的月度生产记录。</p>'}<div class="relationship-production-events">${productionEventRows||'<span>暂无开关井或作业事件</span>'}</div></section></div></article>
